# Scope guard

- Build only what AGENTS.md describes. If a change seems to need more, say so in the pull request instead of building it.
- Do not edit `specs/`. Edit `AGENTS.md` only when Victor asks.
- No line timing. Timing fields, including `startSeconds`, are rejected. No audio scan, follow-scroll, word timing, looping, autoplay, tempo control, or microphone.
- Screens are Song Library, New song, and Learn Song. Routes are the ones in `docs/codebase.md`.
- No accounts, analytics, or a public host. The learner can ask for lyrics, save a song, and attach one MP3.
- Lyric generation is the Groq path in `backend/app/generation/`. A named song reads its original lines from LRCLIB. Do not add LangChain, LangGraph, another provider, or a second offline draft path.
- Never add inactive fields or UI for later.
- If you add a folder, route, setting, or data field, update `docs/codebase.md` in the same change.
